ef 17592186045417] [17592186101075 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186101891 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101075 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186049081 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101075 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "3a6c5464-4745-5574-b9b6-bc8bf2d3168d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101512 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186100233 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101512 #edb/ref 1069 "q-68338" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101512 #edb/ref 1071 "What is $(\\frac{1}{2})^{5} \\div (\\frac{1}{2})^{2}$?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101512 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "5cbf6b15-5da1-5b9b-844a-a35b63cf7c10" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101891 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186101892 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101891 #edb/ref 1061 53732 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101891 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "6b94b979-4e11-52b1-8a9b-15e04e81e4d9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101891 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186102023 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101892 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186101893 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101892 #edb/ref 1061 53733 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101892 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "057713d1-a263-5f53-8bd3-f2d0b39203fc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101892 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186101011 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101893 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186101894 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101893 #edb/ref 1061 53736 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101893 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "9a3ab364-3da0-504d-840e-b9d167aff58d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101893 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186101012 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101894 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186101895 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101894 #edb/ref 1061 53740 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101894 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "ae0d5088-a5b4-5790-b32c-9a5a347afd37" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101894 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186101013 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101895 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186101896 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101895 #edb/ref 1061 53743 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101895 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "022268b4-8f60-5abf-8aa9-00bc872f3753" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101895 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186102024 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101896 #edb/ref 1061 53747 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101896 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "0ae0dbda-f758-51e1-9667-fa2b080a2a6b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186101896 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186101014 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186102023 #edb/ref 1064 "To divide powers of the same base, we simply *subtract* the exponents. This is known as the **quotient rule for exponents**. For instance, in the expression\n\n$$\n{\\color{blue}3}^5 \\div {\\color{blue}3}^2\n$$\n\nboth powers have the same base $({\\color{blue}3})$. Therefore, we can simplify this expression by subtracting the exponents:\n\n$$\n{\\color{blue}3}^5 \\div {\\color{blue}3}^2 = {\\color{blue}3}^{5-2} = {\\color{blue}3}^3\n$$\n\n**Note:** The quotient rule for exponents is really just a quicker alternative to the following process:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n3^{5} \\div 3^{2} &=  \\\\\n3^{3 + 2} \\div 3^{2} &=  \\\\\n3^{3} \\cdot 3^{2} \\div 3^{2}_(⏟)_(= 1) &=  \\\\\n3^{3} \\cdot 1 &=  \\\\\n&= 3^{3}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186102023 #edb/ref 1065 8158 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186102023 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "4547d33f-6904-539f-b917-599af56aac3b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186102023 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186102024 #edb/ref 1064 "We can use the quotient rule for exponents with negative exponents too. For example, to simplify $3^{-5}\\div 3^{-3}$, we subtract the exponents:\n\n$$\n3^{-5} \\div 3^{-3} = 3^{-5-(-3)} = 3^{-2}\n$$\n\nNow, to evaluate $3^{-2}$, we find the reciprocal of the base $(3)$ and then raise that reciprocal to the same power but with the opposite sign:\n\n$$\n3^{-2} = \\left(\\dfrac{1}{3}\\right)^2 =\\dfrac{1}{3} \\times \\dfrac{1}{3} = \\dfrac{1}{9}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186102024 #edb/ref 1065 8160 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186102024 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "b127450f-67ae-5232-a082-2242758636fd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186102024 #edb/ref 1067 "The Quotient Rule With Negative Exponents" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
